Package: susolisting
Title: Shiny Application for EA Listing on Satellite Imagery
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Wild", , "mwild@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application to mark buildings on a Google or Vantor
    (Maxar) satellite map within user-provided enumeration area (EA)
    boundaries. The application requires the input of boundaries in ESRI
    shapefile format, and returns a CSV file with all the listed buildings,
    supports second-stage spatially balanced sampling via 'spsurvey', and
    integrates with 'Survey Solutions' for team assignment creation.
